"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The Turkish Interior Ministry says a ship started taking on water four nautical miles from Kyrenia Port. A search and rescue operation is happening now.\",            \"english_title\": \"Ship Taking on Water\",            \"translated_version\": \"El Ministerio del Interior de Turqu\u00eda dice que un barco comenz\u00f3 a llenarse de agua a cuatro millas n\u00e1uticas del Puerto de Kyrenia. Una operaci\u00f3n de b\u00fasqueda y rescate est\u00e1 sucediendo ahora.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Barco con Agua\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Rajendra Dawadi was warned about flood waters coming. He says if they had waited 10 more minutes, they would not be able to talk today.\",            \"english_title\": \"Flood Warning\",            \"translated_version\": \"Rajendra Dawadi fue advertido sobre la llegada de aguas de inundaci\u00f3n. \u00c9l dice que si hubieran esperado 10 minutos m\u00e1s, no podr\u00edan hablar hoy.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Advertencia de Inundaci\u00f3n\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"An investigation has started about storing weapons for Ukraine's military near homes.\",            \"english_title\": \"Weapons Investigation\",            \"translated_version\": \"Ha comenzado una investigaci\u00f3n sobre el almacenamiento de armas para el ej\u00e9rcito de Ucrania cerca de casas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Investigaci\u00f3n de Armas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Five people in their twenties were hurt after shots were fired at a techno event near Zurich.\",            \"english_title\": \"Shooting at Techno Event\",            \"translated_version\": \"Cinco personas de unos veinte a\u00f1os resultaron heridas despu\u00e9s de que se dispararan tiros en un evento de techno cerca de Z\u00farich.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tiroteo en Evento Techno\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Haakon VIII gave an emotional tribute to his late father, Harald V, and talked about how he wants to rule.\",            \"english_title\": \"Haakon VIII Tribute\",            \"translated_version\": \"Haakon VIII dio un homenaje emocional a su difunto padre, Harald V, y habl\u00f3 sobre c\u00f3mo quiere gobernar.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Homenaje de Haakon VIII\"        }    ]}"